{"id": "86225", "name": "צמצום שבר אלגברי – av/(bv + cv²) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Reduce the following fraction to its lowest terms:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Take out the common factor of the denominator, then cancel it with the numerator.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Factorise the denominator</b><br>Both terms of the denominator contain <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span>, so take it out as a common factor. By factorising the denominator we obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:2}}{{CT:3}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Cancel</b><br>Then we can cancel the \\({{CT:1}}\\) from the numerator and denominator (we assume it is not zero) to obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:4}}. \\]</p>The numbers do not cancel: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\)</span> have no common factor other than <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1\\)</span>.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is not algebraically equivalent to the correct answer.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "gcd(num(ans),denom(ans))", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is algebraically equivalent t